Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20=E6=B7=BB=E5=8A=A0=E7=BD=91=E7=9B=98?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=AD=9B=E9=80=89=E5=8A=9F=E8=83=BD=E5=92=8C=E5=89=8D=E7=AB=AF?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=BC=98=E5=8C=96?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 新增 SearchFilter 侧边栏组件，支持数据源和网盘类型筛选
- 重构 App.vue，实现筛选逻辑和左右分栏布局
- 修复 tsconfig.json 配置问题
- 简化 package.json 依赖，移除不必要的开发依赖
- 添加 GitHub Actions 构建工作流
- 响应式设计，支持桌面端和移动端
---
 .github/workflows/build.yml     |   32 +
 package-lock.json               | 1635 +++++++++++++------------------
 package.json                    |    8 +-
 src/App.vue                     |  164 +++-
 src/components/SearchFilter.vue |  359 +++++++
 tsconfig.json                   |   19 +-
 6 files changed, 1218 insertions(+), 999 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 .github/workflows/build.yml
 create mode 100644 src/components/SearchFilter.vue

diff --git a/.github/workflows/build.yml b/.github/workflows/build.yml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d8c05c5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.github/workflows/build.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+name: Build and Deploy
+
+on:
+  push:
+    branches: [ main, master ]
+  pull_request:
+    branches: [ main, master ]
+
+jobs:
+  build:
+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
+    
+    steps:
+    - uses: actions/checkout@v3
+    
+    - name: Setup Node.js
+      uses: actions/setup-node@v3
+      with:
+        node-version: '18'
+        cache: 'npm'
+    
+    - name: Install dependencies
+      run: npm ci
+    
+    - name: Build
+      run: npm run build
+    
+    - name: Upload artifacts
+      uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3
+      with:
+        name: dist
+        path: dist/
